--TEST--
hovering a key in an attribute's payload shows the key's field and the `///` doc above it in the declaration, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`, `rule:types/shape-type`
--FILE--
<?nvs
attribute Index on class {
    /// The column names, separated by commas.
    columns: string,
    /// `true` means no two rows may have the same values in these columns.
    unique?: bool,
}

#[Index(columns: "email", uni<|>que: true)]
class Order {}
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
```nvs
unique?: bool
```

`true` means no two rows may have the same values in these columns.
